# ================================================================ making peace with family you had cut off

== bold: making peace with family you had cut off / B
base: make peace now, with one eye on the family money
likelier_if: has [striking a deal] +10; has [family business] +5
- B | offer to go into business together, and put up your house to back it | v: achievement, power | act: offer to go into business with the sibling, and put up their house to back it | chance: 40 | grants: business partner | takes_if_fails: homeowner
works: {sibling} shakes on it, and within months the two of them are partners in a small firm.
works: The old rift becomes a working partnership, and {N} and {sibling} run the business side by side.
fails: The venture folds inside a year, and the bank takes {Ns} house to cover the loan.
fails: {sibling} spends the money faster than it comes in, and by the winter {Ns} house is sold to pay the debts.

== bold: making peace with family you had cut off / R
base: ring them that night and pour out everything held in for years
likelier_if: mark 'took them in' +10; has [calming people down] +5
- R | ring them tonight, and ask them to come and stay as long as it takes | v: benevolence, stimulation | act: ring the sibling that night, and ask them to come and stay as long as it takes | chance: 35 | grants: friend for life | drops_if_fails: kind:partner
works: {sibling} arrives with one bag and stays a month, and by the end the two of them are each other's closest friend.
works: Weeks under one roof wear the old quarrel away, and {sibling} becomes the one {N} rings first, for life.
fails: The old rows fill the house within a week, and {Ns} partner, worn out by them, moves out for good.
fails: {sibling} stays, the quarrels never stop, and by the spring {Ns} partner has had enough and leaves.

